      "description": "Blast off into arcade action… right on your wrist!\n\nTake flight as Earth’s best sky-rider in this fast-paced 3D shooter built exclusively for Apple Watch. Dodge trees, weave through columns, and take down waves of bizarre enemies as the world rushes toward you at insane speeds!\n\n• Smooth tilt-to-fly controls for immersive action\n• Rapid-fire blasting\n• Epic boss encounters\n• Infinite arcade challenge — how far can you get?\n• Nostalgic 80s arcade vibe, reimagined for modern wrist gaming\n\nYour mission: Survive the onslaught. Score big. Become a Harrier legend.\n\nThe arcade classic spirit is alive — now you can play it anywhere, anytime.\n\nStrap in. Eyes up. Blast everything.",
